    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Mini Meowcraft</i> is a lightweight RPG where cats are the heroes! Choose your faction, master your abilities, and embark on a journey through a compact but vibrant open world filled with adventure and mischief.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Character Customization:</strong> Create your purr-fect hero with our simple but expressive character creator.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Choose Your Allegiance:</strong> Pledge loyalty to the noble Pawlliance or join the rebellious forces of the Hiss! Your faction choice affects your storyline, playable races, available quests, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Class-Based Gameplay:</strong> Select from unique classes, each with their own special abilities and playstyles. Will you be a stealthy hunter, a powerful warrior, or a mage?<br>- <strong>Compact Open World:</strong> Explore a beautifully crafted world packed with secrets, side quests, and hidden treasures\u2014designed to deliver big adventure in a compact package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Character Progression:</strong> Level up your character, unlock powerful new abilities, and become the ultimate feline champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Gear Hunting:</strong> Collect loot to enhance your stats and abilities. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Mini Meowcraft</i> is a lightweight RPG where cats are the heroes! Choose your faction, master your abilities, and embark on a journey through a compact but vibrant open world filled with adventure and mischief.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Character Customization:</strong> Create your purr-fect hero with our simple but expressive character creator.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Choose Your Allegiance:</strong> Pledge loyalty to the noble Pawlliance or join the rebellious forces of the Hiss! Your faction choice affects your storyline, playable races, available quests, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Class-Based Gameplay:</strong> Select from unique classes, each with their own special abilities and playstyles. Will you be a stealthy hunter, a powerful warrior, or a mage?<br>- <strong>Compact Open World:</strong> Explore a beautifully crafted world packed with secrets, side quests, and hidden treasures\u2014designed to deliver big adventure in a compact package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Character Progression:</strong> Level up your character, unlock powerful new abilities, and become the ultimate feline champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- <strong>Gear Hunting:</strong> Collect loot to enhance your stats and abilities. </p>",
